  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate Security Project (ODA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project continues to work in close partnership with all the inhabited OTs, delivering bespoke Climate Security Assessments which provide summaries of the key issues impacting climate security, resilience and stability in each OT. The assessments provide recommendations for support against areas such as food security, water security, energy security, migration risk, environmental crime and exposure to natural disasters. Implementation projects will be developed with the OTs. Additional cross-territory projects on climate finance mapping, green energy transition and other identified areas of support will be undertaken.</narrative>
  </description>
